Task: Fix blank calendar page (track hijri-calendar_20260820, Phase 4 in-flight): User reported blank screen on /calendar in the running app. Root cause: i18next 26 returns the key string (not the array) for non-string resources unless returnObjects is enabled - t('calendar.weekdays') yielded the string 'calendar.weekdays', so weekdays.map threw TypeError and React unmounted the tree (blank page). Fix: pass { returnObjects: true } to the three array lookups (calendar.weekdays + calendar.gregMonths in calendar.tsx, calendar.gregMonths in date-converter.tsx). Verified: biome + tsc clean; user confirmed the Calendar page renders correctly in the app. Files: src/pages/calendar.tsx, src/components/date-converter.tsx.
